    "notes": "Real Sent list, first page (#sent; Newer disabled: the head of the list). 50 rows, 48 of them conversations (their thread, last and last non-draft ids differ), which give no row: their time is their newest message's, not a send's (grading contract v1.13). Of its 2 one-message rows, one to another person gives 1 observation; one sent only to the account gives none (the account's own mailbox is never a counterparty, and such a row narrows the window like a conversation; it is older than the newest conversation here). Older is enabled (the list goes on) and the newest conversation row is at 09:55 on 17 Sept, so the window starts at 09:56 on 17 Sept and ends at lastSyncAt. Every row repeats its recipients and subject anchor in a hidden screen-reader summary (display: none), which is not read. Subjects, previews, attachment names and the screen-reader summary were hidden at capture (fake text); names and addresses are fake. After capture (security re-review, 2026-10-06) the Inbox tab previews were replaced with fake text, and every link to another site keeps only its host."
  },
